  "title": "Seared Scallops with Grapefruit-Fennel Salad",
  "description": "For a light dinner that&#39;s quick and easy to prepare, try this spinach salad topped with seared scallops, grapefruit, and fennel that&#39;s ready in under 30 minutes.",
